      "text": "he that taketh not his cross, Matt. 10:38 (Luke 14:27). take up his cross, Matt. 16:24 (Mark 8:34; Luke 9:23). to bear his cross, Matt. 27:32 (Mark 15:21; Luke 23:26). come down from the cross, Matt. 27:40 (Mark 15:30). take up the cross, and follow me, Mark 10:21 (3 Ne. 12:30; D&C 23:6). bearing his cross went forth, John 19:17. lest the cross of Christ should be made of none effect, 1 Cor. 1:17. preaching of the cross is to them that perish foolishness, 1 Cor. 1:18. glory, save in the cross of our Lord, Gal. 6:14. reconcile both unto God … by the cross, Eph. 2:16. enemies of the cross of Christ, Philip. 3:18. made peace through the blood of his cross, Col. 1:20. nailing it to his cross, Col. 2:14. endured the cross, Heb. 12:2.",
